{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117023419345-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117081402\"/><p>上水發生盜竊案。昨晚(16日)10時06分，天平路50號安盛苑一單位姓鄭(65歲)男住戶報案，指寓所內一批財物不翼而飛，懷疑被人盜去。</p><p>警員接報到場，鄭男經點算後，共損失一條金手鏈、一枚金戒指、一條金頸鏈、一條鑽石手鏈及約3,000港元現金，所有失物總值約11萬港元。經初步調查後，案件列「盜竊」處理，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:25:24.022993+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T18:34:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T00:39:03.893835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:18:49.718061+00:00","content_hash":"9f2d4ecfa830b877a656e30e269efbfe65bd321c655f363ec59deb214d247cfc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}